    "enUS": {
      "description": "Those awful kobolds are eating my books! You have to get them back before they devour my whole library.",
      "dialogue": {
        "08c6921de828ec8e3a16": "Those awful kobolds are eating my books! You have to get them back before they devour my whole library.",
        "0d02ea2f53a96643ebfa": "Have you rescued my books yet, $N?!",
        "b58ef717f5c113346197": "Thank you so much! Here! Take one of these how-to books. I don't need them.\n\nBut there's still so many books missing. The kobolds don't seem to be eating them. So, why do they want them?"
      },
      "summary": "Retrieve 8 Stolen Books from kobolds in Northshire Valley and return them to Brother Paxton.",
      "title": "Rascally Rodents",
